Subject: [PATCH 4/6] MIG-12 phase 2: finish the row reads; the three rows
 compose the contracts

Migrate the remaining _run_ofCfg destructurings: the tape write/shift scans, the copy-back,
the write-back skips, the apply-phase map and skip, and the three public rows' internal
skip, skip-back, compare and fold reads. The compare read uses the exact-time contract with
compareStop_le supplying the old existential bound. Add the constructor form of the state
renaming; the explicit Cfg.mapState simp sites now rewrite through it. The counter-loop
escape call stays on its run theorem.

